flowchart LR
    BR[Business<br/>Request] --> DRD[Data Requirements<br/>Document]

    DRD --> HLD[High-Level Design /<br/>Architecture]

    HLD --> DM[Data Model<br/>Specifications]

    DRD --> DMD[Data Mapping<br/>Document]
    DM --> DMD
    HLD --> DMD

    DRD --> DQS[Data Quality<br/>Specification]
    DMD --> DQS

    HLD --> LLD[Low-Level<br/>Design]
    DM --> LLD
    DMD --> LLD
    DQS --> LLD

    LLD --> STORIES[Epics &<br/>Stories]
    DRD --> STORIES
    DMD --> STORIES
    DQS --> STORIES

    subgraph gates["Review Gates"]
        RG1{Gate 1}
        RG2{Gate 2}
        RG3{Gate 3}
        RG4{Gate 4}
    end

    DRD --> RG1
    RG1 --> HLD

    DM --> RG2
    RG2 --> DMD

    DQS --> RG3
    RG3 --> LLD

    LLD --> RG4
    RG4 --> STORIES

    style BR fill:#e8e8e8,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style DRD fill:#a8e6cf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style HLD fill:#dcedc1,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style DM fill:#ffd3a5,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style DMD fill:#ffaaa5,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style DQS fill:#ff8b94,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style LLD fill:#d4a5ff,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style STORIES fill:#a5d4ff,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style RG1 fill:#ffd700,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style RG2 fill:#ffd700,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style RG3 fill:#ffd700,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style RG4 fill:#ffd700,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px
    style gates fill:#fff8e1,stroke:#FF9800,stroke-width:2px
